yle=\"position:absolute;top:400px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);color:#fbbf24 !important;font-size:35px;z-index:5;letter-spacing:15px;\">â˜…â˜…â˜…â˜…â˜…</div>\n                \n                <p class=\"hd-draggable\" data-type=\"text\" style=\"position:absolute;top:500px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:700px;text-align:center;color:#f8fafc !important;font-size:36px;font-weight:300;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;z-index:5;margin:0;line-height:1.5;\">\"We've seen a 300% increase in productivity since switching. The customer support is unparalleled, and the features are exactly what we needed to scale.\"</p>\n                \n                <!-- Decorative Quotes -->\n                <div class=\"hd-draggable\" data-type=\"text\" style=\"position:absolute;top:460px;left:180px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.05) !important;font-size:200px;font-weight:900;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;z-index:4;line-height:1;\">\"</div>\n                "
